      "writtenOn": "2018-11-30T07:49:01Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "This is correct, as there are actually two types of flags. The \"real\" R8 flags are all double dash. However for the Android Platform we have added a \"Proguard compatible CLI for R8\", where it is also possible to pass Proguard CLI flags, and these flags are single dash.\n\nFor the Proguard flags -dontshrink and - dontobfuscate there are corresponding R8 flags --no-tree-shaking and --no-minification - but we can change that at a later time.",
